   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_02"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I teach year eleven and they're just not revising. Any ideas to help them?",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.57,
   "block": "studying.dlg28",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Teenagers often don't know how to revise, they just reread. Teaching them a few methods directly can help a lot.",
   "est_sec": 6.3,
   "gap_before": 0.53,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "studying.dlg28"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "First year of uni, and I have to pick a room in the shared house.",
